#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:1
msgid "# OSS with Commercial License Options"
msgstr "# 可選擇商用授權的 OSS"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:3
msgid ""
"Open source software (OSS) by definition permits commercial use.\n"
"However, specific open source licenses establish conditions on redistribution or modification, and vendors may offer commercial licenses for usage scenarios that do not comply with those open source conditions."
msgstr ""
"開放原始碼軟體（OSS）依定義是允許包含商業使用在內的使用方式。\n"
"另一方面，各授權條款各自訂有關於再散布與修改的條件；對於無法滿足這些條件的使用形態，有時會另外提供商用授權。"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:4
msgid "## Why Commercial Licenses Are Offered"
msgstr "## 為什麼會提供商用授權"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:5
msgid ""
"Offering commercial licenses represents a strategic choice by creators and companies to build sustainable business models.\n"
"By releasing core functionality as open source while charging licensing fees for enterprise features, support, or proprietary commercial rights, vendors fund ongoing development and maintenance."
msgstr ""
"這是開發者或企業為建立可持續商業模式所做的策略選擇。\n"
"基本功能以開放原始碼形式提供，同時對企業級功能、支援與商業使用收取授權費用，藉此讓持續開發與維護成為可能。"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:6
msgid ""
"Using dual-licensed software without adhering to open source license conditions results in non-compliant usage, exposing organizations to legal liabilities, unexpected injunctions, and back-license claims.\n"
"Preventing these risks requires thorough pre-use verification and structured license management."
msgstr ""
"若未確認所適用 OSS 授權條款的條件就使用，結果可能構成不符合授權條件的使用，進而發生法律風險、突然被要求停止使用、被請求額外授權費用等嚴重問題。\n"
"要避免這些風險並適切運用 OSS，事前確認與適切的授權管理相當重要。"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:7
msgid "## Scenarios Requiring Commercial Licensing"
msgstr "## 什麼情況下需要商用授權"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:8
msgid "This section outlines primary scenarios where commercial licensing becomes necessary:"
msgstr ""
"本小節說明需要商用授權的主要情況。\n"
"各情況也一併列出應確認的重點。"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:9
msgid "- **Dual-Licensing Models**"
msgstr "- **雙重授權模式**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:10
msgid "  Certain open source software employs dual-licensing models—offering the identical codebase under both an open source license (GPL, AGPL, etc.) and a commercial license."
msgstr ""
"  有些開放原始碼軟體採用雙重授權模式。\n"
"  也就是同一套軟體同時以開放原始碼授權條款（GPL、AGPL 等）與商用授權兩種形式提供。"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:11
msgid ""
"  Selecting the open source option requires strict compliance with its terms (such as source disclosure obligations).\n"
"  If business requirements prevent meeting these open source conditions, purchasing a commercial license becomes mandatory."
msgstr ""
"  若選擇開放原始碼授權版本，就必須遵守該授權條款的條件（原始碼提供義務等）。\n"
"  若無法滿足這些條件，就需要購買商用授權。"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:12
msgid "- **Non-OSS Licensing Terms Triggered by Usage Scale or Operational Metrics**"
msgstr "- **含依使用規模等條件的非 OSS 授權形態**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:13
msgid ""
"  Some source-available software includes conditions tied to organizational revenue, user counts, or usage scale.\n"
"  For example, vendors may require separate commercial contracts for companies exceeding revenue thresholds or organizational scale limits.\n"
"  These licenses do not meet the Open Source Definition (OSD); however, because their source code is publicly accessible, they are easily mistaken for OSS, necessitating careful review of licensing terms prior to adoption."
msgstr ""
"  部分軟體雖然公開原始碼，卻採用依使用規模、營收、員工人數等附加額外條件的授權形態。\n"
"  例如，年營收超過特定金額的企業使用，或達一定規模以上的組織使用時，會被要求另行簽訂商用契約或授權。\n"
"  這些並不符合 OSD 所訂的 OSS 定義，但因為原始碼是公開的，外觀上容易被誤認為 OSS，使用時確認授權條件相當重要。"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:14
msgid "- **Commercial Support and Enterprise Add-On Features**"
msgstr "- **商用支援與企業級附加功能**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:15
msgid ""
"  Some OSS vendors provide core functionality under open source licenses while selling add-on services or enterprise capabilities separately.\n"
"  Enterprise security features, management consoles, and formal SLAs are typically delivered under commercial contracts.\n"
"  When enterprise operational requirements demand these capabilities, organizations purchase commercial agreements alongside open source usage."
msgstr ""
"  有些 OSS 除了在 OSS 授權條款下可使用的核心功能之外，還另外提供設想大規模運作與企業使用的追加功能或服務。\n"
"  例如企業級的資訊安全功能、管理功能、技術支援等，有時是依商用契約提供。\n"
"  當企業的運作需求需要這些附加功能或服務時，除 OSS 之外，通常會有簽訂商用契約的選項。"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:16
msgid "## Covered Software [TO BE EDITED]"
msgstr "## 哪些屬於對象【需編輯】"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:17
msgid "## OSS Requiring Heightened Vigilance [TO BE EDITED]"
msgstr "## 使用時需要注意的 OSS【需編輯】"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:18
msgid "### Evaluation Guidelines"
msgstr "### 確認重點"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:19
msgid "Verify the following points when evaluating new OSS:"
msgstr "導入新的 OSS 時，請確認以下幾點。"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:20
msgid ""
"1. **Review Licensing Terms**: Confirm whether dual-licensing or non-OSS commercial terms apply.\n"
"2. **Evaluate Deployment Models**: Categorize intended use (embedded binary distribution, SaaS delivery, internal tooling).\n"
"3. **Check Organizational Scale Criteria**: Verify whether revenue or employee thresholds trigger non-OSS commercial licensing.\n"
"4. **Assess Feature Requirements**: Determine whether open source features satisfy project requirements or if enterprise commercial add-ons are necessary."
msgstr ""
"1. **確認授權條文**：確認是否為雙重授權，以及所適用的授權條件（OSS 授權條款，"
"或非 OSS 的授權條件）。\n"
"2. **評估使用形態**：明確區分是內嵌使用、SaaS 提供或內部使用等。\n"
"3. **確認企業規模要件**：若訂有依營收或員工人數而定的使用條件，請確認該軟體是"
"否並非 OSS，而是以其他授權形態提供。\n"
"4. **檢視所需功能**：評估在 OSS 授權條款下提供的功能是否已能滿足需求，或是否"
"需要另外提供的企業級附加功能與支援。"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:21
#: operation-templates/compliance/source-disclosure-licenses.md:30
#: operation-templates/compliance/what-is-a-license.md:36
msgid "## Consult the OSPO When Uncertain"
msgstr "## 猶豫時請洽詢 OSPO"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:22
msgid ""
"When licensing terms are ambiguous, consult the OSPO.\n"
"Refer to \"[What Is an OSPO?](../about/ospo.md)\" for contact details.\n"
"Proper license management ensures seamless, efficient open source adoption."
msgstr ""
"若有不清楚之處，請洽詢 OSPO。\n"
"承辦人清單請參閱「[什麼是 OSPO](../about/ospo.md)」。\n"
"透過適切的授權管理，實現順暢而有效率的 OSS 運用。"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:26
msgid ""
"- [ ] Listed representative commercial licenses already purchased internally.\n"
"- [ ] Listed prohibited source-available or dual-licensed software.\n"
"- [ ] Documented licenses requiring special review procedures.\n"
"- [ ] Created dedicated usage guides for frequently used dual-licensed software."
msgstr ""
"- [ ] 已把公司內部已購買商用授權的代表性案例整理成清單\n"
"- [ ] 已列出禁止使用的 OSS 清單\n"
"- [ ] 已寫出使用時需要特別注意的授權條款\n"
"- [ ] 已為經常使用的 OSS 製作專用使用指南"

#. type: 註解
#: operation-templates/compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md:27
msgid ""
"<!--\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"Customization Guide\n"
"\n"
